-31T18:07:00+08:00</updated><content type="html"/><link href="https://ps.hket.com/article/4136627/%E5%90%8D%E6%97%A5%E2%80%A7%E4%B9%9D%E8%82%9A%E5%B1%B14%E6%88%BF%E9%80%BE1977%E8%90%AC%E6%B2%BD%20%E5%91%8E%E5%83%B9%E9%80%BE1.6%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83?mtc=20023"/><published>2026-05-31T18:07:00+08:00</published></entry><entry><id>https://ps.hket.com/article/4136632/DEEP%20WATER%20SOUTH%206A%E6%9C%9F%E4%BB%8A%E6%B2%BD4%E4%BC%99%20%E5%A5%97%E7%8F%BE%E8%BF%915380%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83?mtc=20023</id><title>DEEP WATER SOUTH 6A期今沽4伙 套現近5380萬元</title><updated>2026-05-31T18:59:00+08:00</updated><content type="html"/><link href="https://ps.hket.com/article/4136632/DEEP%20WATER%20SOUTH%206A%E6%9C%9F%E4%BB%8A%E6%B2%BD4%E4%BC%99%20%E5%A5%97%E7%8F%BE%E8%BF%915380%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83?mtc=20023"/><published>2026-05-31T18:59:00+08:00</published></entry><entry><id>https://topick.hket.com/article/4136634/Hong%20Kong%20Comic%20Con%202026%EF%B8%B1%E3%80%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%9C%8B%E8%B3%AD%E7%A5%9E%E3%80%8DDeclan%20Wong%E7%8F%BE%E8%BA%AB%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AFComic%20Con%E3%80%80%E8%88%87%E5%BE%92%E5%BC%9F%E9%A6%AE%E5%BE%B7%E5%80%AB%E7%8E%A9show%20hand%E9%AC%A5%E3%80%8C%E6%91%94%E7%89%8C%E3%80%8D?mtc=20023</id><title>Hong Kong Comic Con 2026︱「法國賭神」Declan Wong現身香港Comic Con　與徒弟馮德倫玩show hand鬥「摔牌」</title><updated>2026-05-31T19:31:00+08:00</updated><content type="html">

&lt;p&gt;Published on: 2026-05-30T19:31:42+08:00 Updated on: 2026-05-30T19:49:44.808+08:00&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="article-detail-content-container"&gt;
&lt;div class="non-paywall"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;【馮德倫 / Comic Con / 法國賭神】&lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/stephenfungible/" target="_blank"&gt;馮德倫&lt;/a&gt;在今日（5月30日）現身&lt;a href="https://www.hkcomiccon.com/?lang=zh-hk" target="_blank"&gt;香港「Comic Con2026」&lt;/a&gt;，宣傳他原創動漫IP「BUCkET MAN」。現場設有一個6米高BUCKET MAN巨型吹氣公仔吸引在場人士外，馮德倫更邀請曾在《賭俠2之上海灘賭聖》飾演「法國賭神Pierre Cashon」、王敏德胞兄Declan Wong任嘉賓在現場進行一場「對賭」。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Declan Wong的二嫂馬詩慧（Janet Ma）和姪女王麗嘉（Irisa）亦專誠到場支持。率先出場的Declan Wong表演魔術後，繼而跟馮德倫大玩show hand，更即場上演經典「摔牌」，表演啤牌魔術，在場人士拍掌叫好。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://topick.hket.com/article/4135460/?lcc=at" title="Hong Kong Comic Con 2026︱天下一攜全新IP大曬冷　動畫《明日戰記：前傳》機密檔案首曝光"&gt;Hong Kong Comic Con 2026︱天下一攜全新IP大曬冷　動畫《明日戰記：前傳》機密檔案首曝光&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;span class="article-detail_inline-image block"&gt;
&lt;picture class="image-gallery-img"&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4135000/4136634/20260529_BucketMan_1477_1200.jpg" media="(min-width: 1200px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4135000/4136634/20260529_BucketMan_1477_600.jpg" media="(min-width: 992px)"/&gt;
